Origin: commit 49cbcad0f7fc0459f06ec65352680040eb414fd2 from https://github.com/godunko/espidf_fatfs.git
Properties:
   Author: Vadim Godunko
   Configuration: no modifiers
   Description: Ada/ESP-IDF: FAT filesystem bindings
   License: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
   Long_Description: Ada bindings for the ESP-IDF FAT filesystem component (`fatfs`).

Covers mounting and unmounting a FAT filesystem located in an internal flash partition
through the wear levelling layer (`esp_vfs_fat_spiflash_mount_rw_wl`), with optional
formatting when the mount fails. Once mounted, files are accessed through the ESP-IDF VFS.

